# Company page hero

Company dropdown pages (`/about`, `/careers`, `/security`, `/customers`) share one hero:

- Use `CompanyHero` from `src/app/CompanyHero.tsx`
- Pattern: GatewayFlow (light) + centered stacked `h1` lines + `pt-8 pb-16 md:pt-10 md:pb-24`
- Pass title as `lines={["Line one", "line two"]}`
- Optional supporting copy goes in `children`

Do not invent a different first-screen hero layout for these pages.
